+/* Two unsigned comparisons against the same value, joined by | or &, are one
+   comparison of the umin or umax of the operands:
+
+     (A <=u C) | (B <=u C)  ==  umin (A, B) <=u C
+     (A <=u C) & (B <=u C)  ==  umax (A, B) <=u C
+     (A >u C) | (B >u C)    ==  umax (A, B) >u C
